ROUND 1 DISPOSITION — verify the repairs, do not re-raise what is closed
Round 1 gave ~15 findings across three vendors. Four were verified at source and
repaired. Three source verifications, for your reference:
 - src/capability/loader.rs:29 is `load_directory`, returning
   Vec<CapabilityDefinition>; `load_from_directory` does not exist; issues are
